<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="goformx-api-origin" content="{{ PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN }}">
  <title>Forms — GoFormX</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/forms.css">
  <script type="module" src="/assets/forms.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to forms</a>
<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/app">GoFormX<span>SCHEMA → SUBMISSION</span></a><button id="logout" type="button">Sign out</button></header>
<main id="main">
  <div class="workspace"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE</p><h1 id="organization">Loading workspace…</h1><p id="role" class="muted"></p></div><div class="actions"><button id="manage-tokens" type="button" disabled>Manage API access</button><button id="new-form" class="primary" type="button" disabled>+ New form</button></div></div>
  <p id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div id="error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden><p id="error-message"></p><ul id="error-fields"></ul><a id="sign-in" href="/login" hidden>Sign in again</a><a id="verify-email" href="/verify-email" hidden>Check email verification</a></div>
  <noscript>This workspace requires JavaScript. The documented GoFormX API is also available to server-side clients.</noscript>
  <p id="integration-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="integration-error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
  <div id="integration-uncertain" class="panel" hidden><p>A change may have succeeded. Reload token/webhook metadata, revoke any unclaimed credential, and reconcile before another mutation. Revocation remains available.</p><button id="acknowledge-integration" type="button">I have reconciled the change</button></div>
  <section id="tokens-panel" class="panel" hidden aria-labelledby="tokens-heading">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="tokens-heading">External API access</h2><button id="reload-tokens" type="button">Reload token metadata</button></div>
    <p>For your server, agent or custom dashboard. Never embed these credentials in public website code. Owners and admins manage this workspace’s machine access.</p>
    <form id="token-create" autocomplete="off"><fieldset id="token-fields"><div class="two-columns"><label>Integration name<input id="token-name" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Token lifetime (days)<input id="token-days" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="30" required></label></div>
      <fieldset id="token-scopes"><legend>Choose only the scopes needed</legend><div class="scope-grid">
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="forms:read"> forms:read</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="forms:write"> forms:write</label>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="forms:publish"> forms:publish</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="submissions:read"> submissions:read</label>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="tokens:read"> tokens:read</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="tokens:write"> tokens:write</label>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="webhooks:read"> webhooks:read</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" value="webhooks:write"> webhooks:write</label>
      </div></fieldset><p class="help">submissions:read exposes received data. tokens:write allows token issuance and revocation within the caller’s authority. No scope is selected by default.</p>
      <label class="check"><input id="token-warning" type="checkbox" required> I understand the token is shown once. I will save it in secret custody, not a public website. Clipboard managers and downloads can retain copies.</label>
      <button class="primary" type="submit">Create scoped token</button>
    </fieldset></form>
    <section id="token-reveal" class="secret-reveal" hidden aria-labelledby="token-reveal-heading"><h3 id="token-reveal-heading">Save this token now</h3><p>Only shown for this creation. Cleared after two minutes, when dismissed, when the tab is hidden, or when the form changes. It cannot be recovered later.</p>
      <label>New external service token<input id="issued-token" readonly autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></label>
      <div class="actions"><button id="copy-token" type="button">Copy token</button><button id="download-token" type="button">Download secret file</button><button id="dismiss-token" type="button">Dismiss token</button></div>
    </section>
    <p class="help">At most 100 recent tokens are shown, not a complete historical inventory. “Not recorded” does not prove a token has never been used. Reload metadata after saving a new token.</p><div id="token-list"></div>
  </section>
  <div class="layout">
    <aside aria-labelledby="forms-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="forms-heading">Forms</h2><button id="refresh" type="button">Refresh</button></div>
      <p id="list-state" role="status">Loading forms…</p><nav id="forms-list" aria-label="Workspace forms"></nav>
      <div class="pagination"><button id="previous" type="button" disabled>Previous</button><span id="page-number"></span><button id="next" type="button" disabled>Next</button></div>
    </aside>
    <section id="welcome" class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">SCHEMA FIRST. YOUR INTERFACE.</p><h2>A form starts with a contract.</h2><p>Create a form from the starter schema, paste your own JSON Schema, or bring one drafted by your own tools. Review it here before publishing.</p><p class="muted">The UI and external clients use the same business API. Your schema stays portable.</p></section>
    <section id="editor-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="editor-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p id="form-status" class="eyebrow"></p><h2 id="editor-heading" tabindex="-1">New form</h2></div><div class="actions"><button id="review-submissions" type="button" hidden>Review submissions</button><button id="reload-form" type="button" hidden>Reload server version</button></div></div>
      <p id="read-only" class="muted" hidden>Your workspace role is read-only. An owner or admin can save and publish.</p>
      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="metadata-heading"><h3 id="metadata-heading">Form details</h3>
        <form id="metadata-form"><fieldset id="metadata-fields"><div class="two-columns"><label>Name<input id="form-name" required pattern="[a-z][a-z0-9-]{2,62}" maxlength="63" placeholder="contact-us" aria-describedby="name-help"></label><label>Title<input id="form-title" required minlength="3" maxlength="100" placeholder="Contact us"></label></div>
          <p id="name-help" class="help">Name is permanent: 3–63 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens; start with a letter.</p>
          <label>Description<textarea id="form-description" rows="2" maxlength="500"></textarea></label>
          <label>Allowed browser origins<textarea id="form-origins" rows="2" placeholder="https://example.com" aria-describedby="origins-help"></textarea></label>
          <p id="origins-help" class="help">One origin per line. Empty blocks cross-origin browser access; it does not mean “allow all.”</p>
          <button id="save-metadata" type="submit" hidden>Save details</button>
        </fieldset></form>
      </section>
      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="schema-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h3 id="schema-heading">JSON Schema</h3><span class="badge">Draft 2020-12</span></div>
        <div class="toolbar"><label id="versions-label" hidden>Saved versions<select id="versions"></select></label><button id="more-versions" type="button" hidden>Load older versions</button><button id="format" type="button">Format JSON</button><button id="download" type="button">Download draft</button></div>
        <p id="version-note" class="help">Save creates a draft. Publishing is a separate, explicit step.</p>
        <div id="schema-editor"></div><p class="help">JSON syntax highlighting, completion and undo are available. Tab leaves the editor. Local syntax checks are not server validation.</p>
        <details id="field-assistance"><summary>Add a field</summary><div class="field-helper"><label>Field name<input id="field-name" maxlength="64" placeholder="company"></label><label>Type<select id="field-type"><option>string</option><option>number</option><option>integer</option><option>boolean</option></select></label><label class="check"><input id="field-required" type="checkbox"> Required</label><button id="add-field" type="button">Add to schema</button></div><p class="help">This helper only adds fields. Existing constraints and advanced schema constructs are retained.</p></details>
        <div class="actions"><button id="save-schema" class="primary" type="button">Validate &amp; create form</button><span id="dirty" role="status"></span></div>
      </section>
      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="preview-heading"><h3 id="preview-heading">Field preview</h3><p class="help">An illustrative preview of simple top-level fields, not a validator or a submission form. Advanced constraints remain in your canonical schema. No remote references are fetched.</p><div id="preview"></div></section>
      <section id="publication" class="panel" hidden aria-labelledby="publication-heading"><h3 id="publication-heading">Publish deliberately</h3><p id="publication-note"></p><button id="publish" class="primary" type="button" disabled>Review publication</button><p class="help">Saving never changes the public schema. Publishing selects one saved version; existing submissions keep their original version.</p></section>
      <section id="integration" class="panel" hidden aria-labelledby="integration-heading"><h3 id="integration-heading">Connect your website</h3><p id="integration-state"></p>
        <label>Public form key<input id="public-key" readonly></label><label>Submission endpoint<input id="submission-endpoint" readonly></label>
        <p class="help">The public key is browser-safe. Never put a service token or first-party assertion in your website. Add the website’s origin above before embedding.</p>
        <pre><code id="integration-example"></code></pre><button id="copy-example" type="button" disabled>Copy JavaScript example</button>
      </section>
      <section id="submissions-panel" class="panel" hidden aria-labelledby="submissions-heading">
        <div class="section-heading"><h3 id="submissions-heading">Submissions</h3><button id="submission-load" type="button">Load submissions</button></div>
        <p id="submission-access" class="help" hidden>Only workspace owners and admins can review submission data.</p>
        <form id="submission-filters"><fieldset id="submission-filter-fields"><div class="two-columns">
          <label>Received from (inclusive)<input name="receivedFrom" placeholder="2026-08-30T00:00:00Z" autocomplete="off"></label>
          <label>Received before (exclusive)<input name="receivedBefore" placeholder="2026-08-31T00:00:00Z" autocomplete="off"></label>
          <label>Accepted schema version<input name="schemaVersion" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off"></label>
          <label>Acceptance status<select name="status"><option value="">All</option><option value="accepted">Accepted</option></select></label>
        </div><p class="help">Use timestamps with an explicit timezone offset. Filters stay in this tab; Go validates their bounds.</p><button type="submit">Apply submission filters</button></fieldset></form>
        <p id="submission-state" role="status"></p><p id="submission-error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
        <div id="submission-list" aria-label="Received submissions"></div>
        <div class="pagination"><button id="submission-previous" type="button" disabled>Previous submissions</button><button id="submission-next" type="button" disabled>Next submissions</button></div>
        <div class="actions"><button id="export-json" type="button" disabled>Export JSON</button><button id="export-csv" type="button" disabled>Export CSV</button></div>
        <p class="help">Exports use the applied filters, not just this page. Maximum 1,000 rows / 8 MiB. CSV cells are text-prefixed for initial spreadsheet opening; edits and re-saves can remove that protection. Use JSON for exact machine-readable values.</p>
        <p id="submission-message" role="status"></p>
        <section id="submission-detail" hidden aria-labelledby="submission-detail-heading"><h3 id="submission-detail-heading" tabindex="-1">Submission detail</h3>
          <dl id="submission-metadata"></dl><p id="submission-redactions" class="help"></p><dl id="submission-values"></dl>
          <details><summary>Exact accepted JSON Schema</summary><pre id="submission-schema"></pre></details>
          <h4>Recent webhook delivery history</h4><div id="submission-deliveries" role="status"></div>
          <p class="help">Acceptance is not webhook delivery. This is a bounded recent form-level window, not complete historical delivery evidence. Replay is a separate privileged action and is not offered here.</p>
        </section>
        <p class="help">Content is cleared when this tab is hidden or the form changes. No submission content is stored locally or sent to AI.</p>
      </section>
      <section id="webhook-panel" class="panel" hidden aria-labelledby="webhook-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h3 id="webhook-heading">Webhook delivery</h3><button id="load-webhook" type="button">Load webhook</button></div>
        <p id="webhook-access" class="help" hidden>Only workspace owners and admins manage webhooks.</p><p id="webhook-state" role="status">Load this form’s webhook to see its current state.</p>
        <p class="help">Pause stops future enqueueing only. Accepted deliveries keep their original destination, headers and signing secret after pause, rotation or deletion. Resuming does not backfill submissions.</p>
        <form id="webhook-settings" autocomplete="off"><fieldset id="webhook-fields"><label>Public HTTPS destination<input id="webhook-url" type="url" required maxlength="2048" autocomplete="off" placeholder="https://example.com/hooks/goformx"></label>
          <label>Custom headers (JSON object, write-only)<textarea id="webhook-headers" rows="2" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="{}"></textarea></label>
          <label>New receiver signing secret<input id="webhook-secret" type="password" minlength="32" maxlength="256" required autocomplete="new-password"></label>
          <div class="actions"><button id="generate-webhook-secret" type="button">Generate signing secret</button><button id="copy-webhook-secret" type="button">Copy signing secret</button></div>
          <label class="check"><input id="receiver-ready" type="checkbox" required> The receiver is ready for this secret. I will keep its old key for outstanding deliveries and dead-letter replay.</label>
          <label class="check"><input id="webhook-enabled" type="checkbox" checked> Enable future deliveries when saving configuration</label>
          <button type="submit">Save complete webhook configuration</button>
        </fieldset></form>
        <p class="help">Full replacement requires all destination/header/secret settings again. Pause/resume and signing-secret rotation preserve omitted fields. Paths, headers and stored signing secrets cannot be read back.</p>
        <div class="actions"><button id="pause-webhook" type="button" disabled>Pause future deliveries</button><button id="rotate-webhook" type="button" disabled>Rotate signing secret only</button><button id="delete-webhook" type="button" disabled>Remove webhook endpoint</button></div>
        <h4>Recent deliveries</h4><button id="load-deliveries" type="button">Load delivery history</button><div id="webhook-deliveries"></div>
        <p class="help">A bounded recent window, not complete historical evidence. Replay is only available for dead letters and retains the original delivery ID and payload. The receiver must deduplicate IDs. A 2xx response is acknowledgement, not proof of signature verification.</p>
      </section>
      <p class="help">Archive and delete are not exposed by the current API. This UI will not pretend to remove your form.</p>
      <p class="help"><a href="/assets/forms.LICENSE.txt">Editor third-party notices</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
<dialog id="publish-dialog" aria-labelledby="publish-title"><h2 id="publish-title">Publish this version?</h2><p id="publish-summary"></p><p>This changes the schema used for new submissions. Review field requirements and compatibility with your website first.</p><div class="actions"><button id="cancel-publish" type="button">Cancel</button><button id="confirm-publish" class="primary" type="button">Publish version</button></div></dialog>
</body></html>
